0..73 Comment "// A task that speaks before it is asked plays another web than one asked"
74..83 Comment "// first."
84..86 Comment "//"
87..161 Comment "// The relay in `forced.gandr` puts the parent\'s request before the task\'s"
162..239 Comment "// reply. Swapping the two sends turns the chain around: the task\'s send, the"
240..316 Comment "// parent\'s receipt and the parent\'s answer. A source stating the forced web"
317..349 Comment "// for this run does not settle."
350..352 Comment "//"
353..430 Comment "// The task sends its notes, then reads the parent\'s answer. The trace states"
431..508 Comment "// the web the runner reports when the forced web is stated against this run."
509..511 Comment "//"
512..571 Comment "// - see: `forced.gandr` — the same exchange, asked first"
572..649 Comment "// - see: #3338 — the run\'s trace and the web a source states for a channel"
651..675 Comment "// The task\'s protocols."
